---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout 
  title="Privacy Policy - Bijli Gyaan"
  description="Bijli Gyaan (bijligyaan.in) ki Privacy Policy. Janein hum log files, cookies, Google AdSense, aur user data protection ko kaise manage karte hain."
>
  <main class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 py-10 text-slate-200">
    
    <!-- Header Card -->
    <div class="bg-slate-900 border border-slate-800 rounded-3xl p-6 md:p-10 shadow-2xl mb-8 relative overflow-hidden">
      <div class="absolute -right-16 -top-16 w-52 h-52 bg-amber-500/10 rounded-full blur-3xl pointer-events-none"></div>
      
      <span class="text-xs font-bold text-amber-400 uppercase tracking-wider bg-amber-400/10 px-3 py-1 rounded-md border border-amber-400/20">
        Legal & Compliance
      </span>
      <h1 class="text-3xl md:text-4xl font-extrabold text-white mt-3">
        Privacy Policy
      </h1>
      <p class="text-slate-400 text-xs md:text-sm mt-2">
        Last Updated: October 2026 • Effective Date: January 2026
      </p>
      
      <p class="text-slate-300 text-sm md:text-base mt-4 leading-relaxed">
        <strong>Bijli Gyaan</strong> (<a href="https://www.bijligyaan.in/" class="text-amber-400 hover:underline">https://www.bijligyaan.in/</a>) par hum apne har visitor ki privacy ka samman karte hain aur uski suraksha ke liye pratibadh hain. Yeh Privacy Policy batati hai ki jab aap humari website access karte hain, toh hum kis tarah ki information collect karte hain aur uska upyog kaise hota hai.
      </p>
    </div>

    <!-- Privacy Clauses Body -->
    <div class="bg-slate-900 border border-slate-800 rounded-3xl p-6 md:p-10 space-y-8 shadow-xl text-slate-300 text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed">
      
      <!-- 1. Information We Collect -->
      <section>
        <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-white mb-3 flex items-center gap-2">
          <span class="text-amber-400">1.</span> Information We Collect & Log Files
        </h2>
        <p class="mb-3">
          Bijli Gyaan standard log files ka upyog karta hai, jaisa ki lagbhag sabhi web hosting platforms aur analytics services karti hain. Jab aap humari website visit karte hain, toh automatic roop se kuch non-personal technical information log hoti hai:
        </p>
        <ul class="list-disc list-inside space-y-1.5 text-slate-300 pl-2">
          <li><strong>IP Address (Internet Protocol Address):</strong> Geolocation aur security monitoring ke liye.</li>
          <li><strong>Browser & Device Type:</strong> Chrome, Safari, Firefox, Android ya Windows/Mac.</li>
          <li><strong>Date & Time Stamp:</strong> Site visit aur article reading duration.</li>
          <li><strong>Referring / Exit Pages:</strong> User flow ko analyse karne ke liye.</li>
        </ul>
        <p class="mt-3 text-xs text-slate-400 bg-slate-950 p-3 rounded-xl border border-slate-800">
          ⚠️ <em>Yeh sara log data non-personally identifiable hota hai, jiska mukhya maqsad website speed, server security aur user experience ko behtar banana hai.</em>
        </p>
      </section>

      <!-- 2. Cookies & Web Beacons -->
      <section class="border-t border-slate-800 pt-6">
        <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-white mb-3 flex items-center gap-2">
          <span class="text-amber-400">2.</span> Cookies and Web Beacons
        </h2>
        <p class="mb-3">
          Bijli Gyaan visitors ki preferences store karne aur user behavior ko samajhne ke liye cookies ka istemal karta hai. Isse hum ye jaan pate hain ki visitors ko hamare kaun se electrical guide aur solar calculator tools sabse zyada pasand aa rahe hain.
        </p>
        <p>
          Aap chahein toh apne personal web browser (Google Chrome, Firefox, Safari) ki settings me jaakar cookies ko kabhi bhi disable ya delete kar sakte hain.
        </p>
      </section>

      <!-- 3. Google AdSense & DART Cookies -->
      <section class="border-t border-slate-800 pt-6">
        <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-white mb-3 flex items-center gap-2">
          <span class="text-amber-400">3.</span> Google DoubleClick DART Cookies & AdSense
        </h2>
        <p class="mb-3">
          Google hamari website par third-party vendor ke roop mein vigyapan (advertisements) display karne ke liye cookies ka upyog karta hai:
        </p>
        <ul class="list-disc list-inside space-y-1.5 pl-2 mb-3">
          <li>Google <strong>DART cookies</strong> ka upyog karta hai, jisse visitors ke pichle browsing history aur interests ke aadhar par unhe relevant ads dikhaye ja saken.</li>
          <li>Visitors Google ad and content network privacy policy par jaakar DART cookie opt-out kar sakte hain:  
            <a 
              href="https://policies.google.com/technologies/ads" 
              target="_blank" 
              rel="noopener noreferrer" 
              class="text-amber-400 underline font-medium"
            >
              https://policies.google.com/technologies/ads
            </a>
          </li>
        </ul>
      </section>

      <!-- 4. Affiliate Disclosure -->
      <section class="border-t border-slate-800 pt-6">
        <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-white mb-3 flex items-center gap-2">
          <span class="text-amber-400">4.</span> Affiliate Disclosure
        </h2>
        <p class="mb-3">
          Bijli Gyaan par kuch recommended electrical tools (jaise Multimeter, Wire Stripper, MCB/RCCB brands) aur solar equipment ke affiliate links shamil ho sakte hain (jaise Amazon Associates Program).
        </p>
        <div class="bg-amber-400/10 border border-amber-400/30 rounded-xl p-4 text-xs md:text-sm text-slate-300">
          <strong>Disclosure:</strong> Agar aap hamare diye gaye affiliate link par click karke koi product kharidte hain, toh hume bina kisi extra kharche ke chhota referral commission mil sakta hai. Isse aapke liye product ki actual keemat mein 1 paise ka bhi badlao nahi hota.
        </div>
      </section>

      <!-- 5. Third Party Policies -->
      <section class="border-t border-slate-800 pt-6">
        <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-white mb-3 flex items-center gap-2">
          <span class="text-amber-400">5.</span> Third-Party Privacy Policies
        </h2>
        <p>
          Bijli Gyaan ki Privacy Policy sirf hamari website par laagu hoti hai. Agar aap hamare kisi external link (jaise government DISCOM portal, PM Surya Ghar website ya external tools) par jaate hain, toh unki privacy policy alag ho sakti hai. Hum un third-party websites ki privacy practices ke liye uttardayi nahi hain.
        </p>
      </section>

      <!-- 6. Children's Information -->
      <section class="border-t border-slate-800 pt-6">
        <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-white mb-3 flex items-center gap-2">
          <span class="text-amber-400">6.</span> Children's Online Privacy Protection (COPPA)
        </h2>
        <p>
          Internet par bacchon ki suraksha hamari prathmikta hai. Bijli Gyaan 13 saal se kam umar ke bacchon se kisi bhi tarah ki Personally Identifiable Information (PII) jaanbujhkar collect nahi karta. Agar aapko lagta hai ki aapke bacche ne hamare form ya comment ke jariye aisi jankari share ki hai, toh turant humse sampark karein, hum use apne record se turant delete kar denge.
        </p>
      </section>

      <!-- 7. Consent & Updates -->
      <section class="border-t border-slate-800 pt-6">
        <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-white mb-3 flex items-center gap-2">
          <span class="text-amber-400">7.</span> Consent & Updates
        </h2>
        <p class="mb-3">
          Hamari website ka upyog karke aap hamari Privacy Policy aur iske niyamon se apni sahmat (Consent) vyakt karte hain.
        </p>
        <p>
          Naye government regulations ya AdSense guidelines ke mutabiq is Privacy Policy ko samay-samay par update kiya ja sakta hai.
        </p>
      </section>

      <!-- Contact Card Inside Policy -->
      <div class="border-t border-slate-800 pt-6 flex flex-col sm:flex-row items-start sm:items-center justify-between gap-4">
        <div>
          <h3 class="text-white font-bold text-base">Privacy Queries & Contact</h3>
          <p class="text-slate-400 text-xs mt-1">
            Agar Privacy Policy se juda koi sawal hai, toh aap hume direct likh sakte hain:
          </p>
        </div>
        <a 
          href="mailto:officialpramod91@gmail.com" 
          class="bg-amber-400 text-slate-950 font-bold px-4 py-2 rounded-xl text-xs hover:bg-amber-300 transition-colors shrink-0"
        >
          ✉ officialpramod91@gmail.com
        </a>
      </div>

    </div>
  </main>
</Layout>